# Token Efficiency

Optimize for lower Plan & usage spend. Prefer the smallest useful action.

## Responses

- Keep answers short; no task restating or long wrap-ups
- Do not paste large unchanged code into chat
- Cite paths and small diffs instead of dumping whole files

## Exploration

- Read or search only what the task needs
- Prefer targeted reads (offset/limit) over whole-file or whole-repo dumps
- Skip exploratory tool loops when the path is already clear
- Batch independent reads only when a few files are truly required

## Edits

- Touch the fewest files; use patches, not full-file rewrites
- No unsolicited docs, READMEs, summaries, or refactors
- Do not expand scope beyond what was asked
